<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Richfood cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Richfood cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said it downgraded Richfood Holdings Inc to long-term buy from buy, citing near-term uncertainty over the company's outlook.</p>
<p>-- Said third quarter earnings growth was &quot;outstanding&quot; but expressed concern over strategic direction of company.</p>
<p>-- Cited Richfood management's consideration of acquisitions of some of its retailing customers and the &quot;understandable confusion about the strategic direction these retail deals may take the group...&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares fell one to 22-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
